Template: homelab-search/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host to bootstrap this app's roles/schema on:
 Used only once, at first install, to run homelab-bootstrap-app-role.

Template: homelab-search/pgbouncer_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PgBouncer host to register this app's runtime role with:
 Used only once, at first install. Also written into config.yml's
 database.host, so the running service connects through the pooler.

Template: homelab-search/mail_root
Type: string
Default: /srv/mail-ro
Description: Read-only mount of the dovecot mail store:
 Must be exported read-only by the NAS as well, not merely mounted -o ro.
 See install-orchestrators/search-hosts-nfs.sh.

Template: homelab-search/drive_root
Type: string
Default: /srv/drive-ro
Description: Read-only mount of the drive blob store:
 Blobs are stored flat by uuid, so this directory is never enumerated --
 a blob is only opened for a uuid an account-scoped query returned.

Template: homelab-search/listen_port
Type: string
Default: 2517
Description: Port the search web app will listen on:
 Phase 2. The indexer itself listens on nothing.

Template: homelab-search/sso_base
Type: string
Default:
Description: Public homelab-sso base URL (browser redirect target):
 Must be the PUBLIC SSO vhost -- this is where the browser is sent to sign in.

Template: homelab-search/sso_internal_base
Type: string
Default:
Description: Internal homelab-sso base URL (server-to-server):
 Where this app exchanges the authorization code. Defaults to the public URL
 if left blank, which is only correct when SSO is on this same host.

Template: homelab-search/sso_secret
Type: password
Description: SSO client secret for client_id "search":
 Must match exactly what homelab-sso's own clients: block holds.

Template: homelab-search/public_base_url
Type: string
Default: https://search.mailmasker.org
Description: This app's own public URL:
 Used to build the OAuth redirect_uri.

Template: homelab-search/api_base
Type: string
Default: http://api.svc.homelab:3000
Description: Base URL where homelab-api is reachable:
 Every request is authenticated by introspecting the caller's JWT here.
